# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repository must never contain participant data. See docs/privacy.md.
# The rules below are a safety net, not a substitute for checking what you add.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Raw and derived media
*.mp4
*.mp3
*.wav
*.avi
*.mkv
*.m4a
*.bag
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.heic

# Participant-level records
ParticipantLog*
participant_log*
*prolific*
*Prolific*
users.csv
*results.json
*_annotations.json
*_aggregate.json
*.vtt
transcript*/
extracted_audio*/
Study Sessions/
Pilot Sessions/
ParticipantsJSON/
survey_data/
midq*
*Qualtrics*
*qualtrics*

# Model-ready feature matrices and intermediates (large, derived from raw media)
all_data_*.csv
df_interpolated*
merged_feats*/
opensmile_feats/
openface/
vad_logs*
*.pkl
*.pth
*.h5
*.npy
*.hdf5

# Secrets
.env
*.key
*token*
!**/tokenizer*

# Tooling
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/
wandb/
.DS_Store
*.zip

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Exception: data_samples/ holds hand-written synthetic examples of each file
# format. They are named after the real files on purpose, so the rules above
# would otherwise swallow them. Nothing real may ever be placed in this folder.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!data_samples/**
